# Live edits on Moria

The Windows checkout is not the running app. Tailnet Rivendell is the tree on Moria.

- SSH: `ssh -o BatchMode=yes moria` (LAN). Off-LAN: `ssh -o BatchMode=yes moria-ts`
- Repo: `/home/mrchevyceleb/samwise/Personal-Apps/Rivendell`
- Service: `systemd --user` unit `rivendell`
- After source changes: `cd /home/mrchevyceleb/samwise/Personal-Apps/Rivendell && npm run build && systemctl --user restart rivendell`
- Health: `curl -sS http://localhost:8091/api/health` on Moria

Read and write files on Moria via SSH (or a mounted remote path). Local Windows edits do not appear on the tailnet.
